Package: PredictionMatching
Title: Prediction-domain Adaptive Weighting for Cross-Validation Evaluation
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Jan", "Linnenbrink", email = "jan.linnenbrink@uni-muenster.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements prediction-domain adaptive weighting via raking to reduce evaluation bias from preferential training samples.
 The method reweights cross-validation errors so they better reflect the target prediction domain's properties,
  supporting more accurate spatial machine learning model evaluation (Brenning and Suesse 2026 <10.48550/ARXIV.2603.29981>).
